<article class="env-lemma" id="09B5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09B5">Lemma <span data-tag="09B5">61.27.3</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a scheme. Let $\Lambda $ be a Noetherian ring. The category of constructible sheaves of $\Lambda $-modules on $X_{pro\text{-}\acute{e}tale}$ is a weak Serre subcategory of $\textit{Mod}(X_{pro\text{-}\acute{e}tale}, \Lambda )$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a formal consequence of Lemmas <a href="/tag/09AK" data-tag="09AK">61.27.2</a> and <a href="/tag/09B1" data-tag="09B1">61.19.8</a> and the result for the étale site (Étale Cohomology, Lemma <a href="/tag/03RZ" data-tag="03RZ">59.71.6</a>). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>